        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/escher/{size}/4865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-05-09T00:56:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've run a couple sessions from the Starter set, but I'm still unclear on a few aspects, particularly Boosts (and Hinders).</p><p>First off, it says boosts and hinders apply to the 'effect die', but which die is that when more than one die are doing things?&nbsp; For example, when Absolute Zero uses Heat Sink, he attacks with Absorption (Mid die, by default), then also hinders using the Min die.&nbsp; Are they both effect dice?&nbsp; Does a boost apply to one or both?&nbsp; Even more on point, Bunker's Grenade Launcher applies all three dice, so should one boost apply to one die, or all three?&nbsp; (And if they affect one die each, and I had two boosts and a hinder, could I choose to split them up to boost or hinder different effect dice?)</p><p>Second, can you choose <em>not</em> to apply a boost? Or a hinder?&nbsp; (I assume it would be controlled by whomever created it.)&nbsp; The main reason I ask is as it relates to Unity creating bots, where you can burn boosts to add special abilities or effects to your minions.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:15.346Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 7,
